    "description": "Discover an exceptional investment opportunity in Central Richmond with these charming period flats, each offering over 1,600 sqft of spacious living. Featuring beautiful period details, including cove ceilings, crown molding, and hardwood flooring, each unit boasts a cozy living room with a fireplace, a formal dining room, an eat-in kitchen, two bedrooms plus a sunroom, and a split bath. With side-by-side parking, W/D hook-ups, and a large flat backyard perfect for entertaining, you can live in one unit while generating rental income from the other the upper flat is currently vacant and ready for your personal touch. Ideally located near Park Presidio and Golden Gate Park, this unique property is a must-see for homeowners and investors alike!"
